  <title>Final Exam Time</title>

  <p>
    The final exam time for this class is scheduled for <alert>Wednesday, December 16 at 8:00 am</alert>. 
  </p>
  <p>
    We will use the final exam time for our last quiz. There will be no new standards. 
    Instead, this will be the final time to retake any previous standards to improve your grade. You do not need 
    to attend the final exam time if you do not wish to retake any previous standards.
  </p>

